    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Available 5th November**Unfurnished**A1 rated**Most beautiful modern mews house tucked down a private laneway, the house comprises two double bedrooms, one good sized single, study room/4th bedroom, two bathrooms. The property is completely private and is not overlooked. The location could not be better, Sandycove Beach, The Forty Foot and all the wonderful amenities that this popular spot can offer. Schools in the area include Castlepark, Loreto Dalkey, Rathdown, Cluny, Harold NS and Monkstown CBC. Accommodation in brief: entrance hall, guest w.c., livingroom with feature wall mounted electric fire, dining area, kitchen leads off with excellent range of appliances to include double electric oven + hob, warming oven, larder fridge, dishwasher. There is an utility room off with larder freezer, washer/dryer machine, built-in storage. UPSTAIRS: two lovely bright double bedrooms with half mirrored sliding wardrobes, further single bedroom with wardrobes, home office/4th bedroom with shelving. Two of the bedrooms have en-suite bathrooms. OUTSIDE: gorgeous south facing patio with raised flower beds, metal shed for storage, car port which allows 2 cars to park comfortably. Special features include: **Alarm monitoring service included in the rent**Economical NEURA HEATING SYSTEM**Water filter system**Fiber cabling for broadband**VIEWING HIGHLY RECOMMENDED OF THIS BEAUTIFUL HOME"
      },
      {
